{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷里活女星安祖蓮娜祖莉（Angelina Jolie）最近低調到訪柬埔寨，柬埔寨是其養子麥杜斯（Maddox）的出生地。</p><p>她於2002年與影星前夫畢彼特（Brad Pitt）一同於當地領養麥杜斯。</p><p>事隔多年，安祖蓮娜舊地重遊。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.760733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:50:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:16.907970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:16.907970+00:00","content_hash":"259d8264745a9b59887634dd845e4d4b3e2da5ba73acae7ee6311e505109c8fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}